    "level": "restricted",
    "note": "Volunteer-staffed; drive-up and cab visits only when staffed; no overnight stays. The 2025 Mountains Foundation page reported a Line Fire closure order, which the Forest Service page updated May 11, 2026 does not mention."
  },
